meaning of coffee shop {
    Barista presents the menu to the user then accept the menu choice from the user.
    if the user selected coffee, then add coffee to cart.
    if the user selected a bagel, then add bagel to cart.
    if the user terminates the transaction, then clear the cart and return to the menu.
    if the user proceeds with the payment, then calculate cost then hand user the bill then accept payment from user.
}

meaning of calculate cost {
    set total_cost to 0 with type float.
    for each item in cart, get cost of {item} and add to total_cost.
}

meaning of hand user the bill {
    set user_prompt to "User owes {total_cost}" with type string.
    prompt terminal with user_prompt.
}

meaning of accept menu choice from the user {
    accept user terminate input and store in menu_choice.
}

meaning of Barista presents the menu to the user {
    get formatted menu then display in terminal.
}

meaning of the user selected coffee {
    menu_choice equals "coffee".
}

meaning of the user selected bagel {
    menu_choice equals "bagel".
}

meaning of the user terminated the transaction {
    menu_choice equals "terminate".
}

meaning of the user proceeded with the payment {
    menu_choice equals "checkout".
}

meaning of accept payment from user {
    # TODO: Verify payment amount.
    accept user_payment from terminal.
}
